        "original_id": "24ee8078-1f02-5331-94e8-e5a1d312882c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cleo Demetriou, Sophia Kiely, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo, Sophia Dall'aglio, Kerry Ingram, Eleanor Worthington Cox\n- Works: So Awkward, Mache Man, Made of Paper\n- Roles: Lily Hampton, Jas (Jasmine) Salford, Martha Fitzgerald\n\nFacts:\n- Cleo Demetriou played Lily Hampton in the CBBC show \"So Awkward\".\n- \"So Awkward\" stars Cleo Demetriou as Lily Hampton, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo as Jas (Jasmine) Salford, and Sophia Dall'aglio as Martha Fitzgerald.\n- Cleo Demetriou sang \"Made of Paper,\" the soundtrack accompanying the short film \"Mache Man\".\n- Sophia Kiely shared the role with Cleo Demetriou, Kerry Ingram, and Eleanor Worthington Cox.",
